      "id": "ppads_047",
      "category": "language_english",
      "query": "Explain how to make a lifestyle shot, and answer in English.",
      "answer": "A lifestyle shot shows a product in a real-life setting, helping potential buyers imagine themselves using it.\n\nTo create a lifestyle shot using AI, you generally need to:\n1.  **Create a Product Sheet:** Start by making a \"Product Sheet\" from 5-7 photos of your product taken from different angles in natural light. This sheet ensures the AI keeps your product consistent across different images. (This is covered in Lesson 02).\n2.  **Use a Prompt with the Product Sheet:** Upload your product sheet as a reference. Then, use a prompt that describes the desired real-life setting.\n\nHere's an example prompt structure for a lifestyle shot:\n\"Use the uploaded product sheet as the reference. Keep the [PRODUCT] exactly the same — same shape, same colour, same details, same text and logo, do not redesign it. Place it on a warm wooden desk next to a white coffee mug and a small green plant, soft morning window light from the left, shallow depth of field, realistic lifestyle product photography.\" (This example is from Lesson 02).\n\nThis approach helps the AI generate an image where your product looks natural and appealing in an everyday environment.",
